; Above: Cache -> Store keeps enough to pair (renamed). Below: Mailer -> Notifier keeps too little (removed + added).
(block Sys
  (shape Key (sketch "A lookup key."))
  (shape Mail (sketch "An outgoing email."))
  (level
    (block Store
      :type "Store"
      (takes Key :as get)
      (sketch "Keeps the latest value per key on disk."))
    (block Notifier
      :type "Service"
      (takes Mail :as push)
      (sketch "Pushes a notification to every phone."))))
